# Slam after partner's 3NT (2026-09-27).
card    Basic-Bridge
dealer  S
# 1NT (15-17) ... responder's 3NT is the simplest way to put a range on partner.
N AQ4.KJ5.AQJ3.K75      | 1D P 2C P 3N P | 6N/4N | 20 opposite opener's 3NT: slam territory
N 874.KJ5.Q953.K75      | 1D P 2C P 3N P | P   | 9: no slam

# Responder after opener's new suit: the same count, in points.
N T87.Q7.AKT9.KQJ4      | 1H P 2C P 2S P                       | 6NT    | 15 facing a reverse after two over one: 33 points between us
N Q54.K92.KJT3.AJ5      | 1C P 1D P 2S P                       | 6NT    | 13 facing a jump shift (20+ points): BBA also reaches 6NT (1m-3N 316)

